    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="effcc103-0a05-589b-ae36-77163e67f64d" activityNameId="12879fb6-6992-5e0d-875d-30261a63327c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Synthetic natural gas from catalytic methanation, distributed by pipeline, produced by Electrolysis, PEM us [cf5de66a89]</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Synthetic natural gas from catalytic methanation, distributed by pipeline, produced by Electrolysis, PEM using electricity from Solar PV + Wind (MA), and carbon from DAC
This dataset represents the supply of 1 kilogram of synthetic natural gas The gas is distributed by pipeline over 250 km from regional storage.  The synthetic natural gas from catalytic methanation is produced by  Electrolysis, PEM, with electricity from Solar PV + Wind (MA) as feedstock. Transmission loss [% output]: 0.08. Distribution loss [% output]: 0.2%. Regional storage loss [% output]: 0. For more information, refer to: Sacchi, R. and Bauer, C. LCA of Power-to-X processes and applications in the residential sector. Paul Scherrer Institut, 2023. Source: Sacchi, R. and Bauer, C. LCA of Power-to-X processes and applications in the residential sector. Paul Scherrer Institut, 2023.

 UUID: e2767ad5-8224-39a3-b054-79ae34e5a74a
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Literature data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e2767ad5-8224-39a3-b054-79ae34e5a74a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
